  "family_quality_rules": [
    "Foliage is built from a few large masses, never leaf-by-leaf wallpaper.",
    "Trunks, roots, logs, water edges, rocks, and ruins should be satisfying coloring objects.",
    "Use open lanes and canopy gaps to preserve negative space.",
    "A forest page must read as a specific woodland place rather than generic plants behind a monster."
